== Effect ==
* Upon exploding, {{E|Bomb}}s shoot 10 tears off in every direction, similar to {{i|Tammy's Head}}. The tears deal a flat 25 damage plus Isaac's damage and are affected by any tear modifiers Isaac has on his tears.
* Grants five bombs.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} This item has a 1/7 chance to drop if {{e|Hornfel}} is killed in his second phase.{{dlc-}}
* The tears generated by the bombs can push other bombs. Dropping multiple Sad Bombs is not advised since they could be pushed near you.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Anti-Gravity}}: Tears will hover in place for a few seconds before dispersing.
* {{i|BBF}}/{{i|Best Friend}}/{{i|Bob's Brain}}/{{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}/{{i|Mr. Boom}}: Gains the Sad Bombs effect.
* {{i|Blood Bombs}}: Gives the bombs a unique visual appearance (red tears), and changes the color of the tears shot to red.
* {{i|Blood Clot}}: The bombs produce tears that mimic the tear last fired before explosion.
* {{i|Bomber Boy|anr}}: Each explosion releases 10 tears in all directions.
* {{dlc|a}} {{i|Brimstone}}: Bombs explode into Brimstone beams in all directions.
* {{i|Compound Fracture}}/{{i|Cricket's Body}}/{{i|The Parasite}}: Bombs explode into tears that will split.
* {{dlc|anr}} {{i|Dr. Fetus}}/ {{I|Epic Fetus}}: Fired bombs/missiles will explode into tears.
** {{dlc|r}} Fired bombs/missiles have a chance to explode into tears. This chance scales with [[luck]], going up to 100% at 30 luck.
* {{tf|Guppy}}: The bomb’s tears can also generate flies.
* {{i|Haemolacria}}: Bombs explode into Haemolacria tears which burst into tears.
* {{i|Kamikaze!}}: Tears will explode after activating the item.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}: Bombs explode into knives that don't return.
* {{i|Multidimensional Baby}}: Each tear from the bomb will be duplicated.
* {{dlc|a+}}[[Familiars#Locusts|Red Locusts]]: A ring of 10 tears is shot outward upon detonation, which are affected by Isaac's tear modifiers, and deal damage equal to 15 + 0.6x, where x is Isaac's Damage.
* {{i|Scatter Bombs}}: All mini bombs gain the effect and deal full damage.
** {{dlc|r}}Tears from extra explosions deal 65% of their normal damage.
* {{i|Technology}}: Bombs explode into Technology beams in all directions.
* {{i|Tech X}}: Bombs explode into Technology beams in all directions.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|20/20}}/{{i|The Inner Eye}}/{{i|Mutant Spider}}: Does not affect the amount of tears when bombs explode.
* {{dlc|r}}{{i|Bomber Boy}}: Only the center most explosion creates 10 tears.
* {{i|Explosivo}}: Tear explosions are not affected by Sad Bombs.
* {{i|Ipecac}}: Normal Ipecac shots won't explode into tears, but placed bombs will shoot Ipecac shots in every direction.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}/{{i|Marked}}: Tears that burst from bombs cannot be controlled.
* {{i|My Reflection}}: Tears will return to the place where the bomb exploded, not Isaac.
* {{i|Tiny Planet}}: Tears orbit around where the bomb exploded, not Isaac.
* {{i|Tech.5}}: No effect.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{i|Technology 2}}: Bombs only explode into tears with a slight damage reduction.
** {{dlc|r}}The damage reduction is removed.

